{"id":2135,"level":75,"name":"Пішакова вилка (2)","group":"Сила пішака","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Pawns are often underestimated. While they may be the least mobile pieces on the board, they serve critical roles. Their low value is their strength. Imagine if a pawn could trade itself for a higher-value piece! Thatâs the power of the pawn fork. When a pawn attacks two pieces at once, it almost guarantees youâll win a piece on the next move.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":80,"examples":[{"fen":"8/8/1p3p2/3r4/1b1p1B2/kP4PP/P1R1K1P1/8 b - - 0 40","pgn":"{[%csl Rc2,Re2][%evp 0,3,-370,-403,-404,-403]} 40... d3+ 41. Kd1 dxc2+ * ","text":"<p>За допомогою вмілого шаху чорний пішак створює виграшну подвійний напад.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r2qk2r/pp1bppb1/1n1p2pp/8/3NPBnP/2N3Q1/PPP2PP1/2KR1B1R b kq - 0 12","pgn":"{[%csl Rd4,Rf4][%evp 0,3,-195,-211,-211,-217]} 12... e5 13. Ndb5 exf4 * ","text":"<p>Білі не звертали пильної уваги, оскільки чорний пішак може раптово створити розвилку в центрі.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78413,"fen":"1bkr3r/pp2qpp1/2p1p3/7n/3PQPNp/2P4P/PP4P1/R1B1R1K1 b - - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Re4,Rg4][%evp 0,3,-220,-222,-260,-275]} {Q=1} 20... f5 21. Qf3 fxg4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Перевірте, чи можете ви роздробити дві фігури пішаком."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78423,"fen":"rn1qk1nr/pp3p2/4pbp1/3p3p/6b1/2NPQNP1/PPP2PBP/R1B1K2R b KQkq - 0 10","pgn":"{[%csl Rc3,Re3][%evp 0,3,-230,-222,-238,-238]} {Q=1} 10... d4 11. Nxd4 Bxd4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Перевірте, чи можете ви роздробити дві фігури пішаком."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78414,"fen":"2k4r/ppp3pp/8/4Pp2/4r1nP/2P3B1/P4PP1/R4RK1 w - - 0 19","pgn":"{[%csl Re4,Rg4][%evp 0,3,204,221,243,254]} {Q=1} 19. f3 Rc4 20. fxg4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Перевірте, чи можете ви роздробити дві фігури пішаком."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78418,"fen":"r1b2rk1/pp3ppp/2nq